			"notes": "### DRT 1.0.10\n\ncosmetics and detection fixes\n\n**new stuff**\n- Added shared cosmetic rendering between DRT, BetterPV and Skylist so they no longer fight for rendering priority\n- Added a **Hide UI** button to the overlay (open inv to see it)\n\n**loot fixes**\n- Fixed some loot items having no icon\n- Fixed some loot not being counted correctly\n- Enchanted books now log properly when Hypixel only shows `Enchanted Book`\n\n**detection fixes**\n- Chest tier is now resolved correctly when the chest opens as `Master Catacombs - Floor X`\n\n**pricing fixes**\n- Kuudra Vitality books now use their old Mana price entries for pricing\n- Fixed pricing for Crimson and other essences\n- Switched prices from `athen.aerii.xyz/prices` to `api.vyriv.dev/v1/prices`\n\n**reports**\n- Usernames are now hidden from bug report paths\n- Added `openfolder <reportId>` for opening report folders\n\n**other**\n- Updated for both 26.1.2 and 26.2\n- Various smaller fixes and cleanup throughout the mod"
		},
