			"notes": "### DRT update\n\nfurther fixes to tracking, new fancy menu, onboarding tweaks\n\n**new stuff**\n- `/drt toggle` for croesus overlay and essence tracking is now included in the onboarding screen with a preview\n- new fancy menu for reward chests (replaces vanilla chest UI)\n\t- disabled by default, run `/drt config` to enable\n\n**fixes**\n- fixed session runs sometimes counting wrong across lobbies / restarts\n- fixed master stars not applying correctly in profit\n- fixed kismet getting billed twice on rerolls\n- fixed rare reward chat occasionally duplicating loot\n- fixed floor state confusing dungeon vs kuudra chests\n- fixed croesus overlay wiping / losing its cache mid-menu"
		},
