			"notes": "### DRT update\n\npretty big tracking/bugfix update\n\n**new stuff**\n- `/drt toggle` is split into **UI, tracking, CroOverlay and essence** now\n- added **Mod Menu support**, opens the normal DRT setup/config (thanks <@238809504374980618>)\n- kuudra keys now account for **reputation discounts**\n- cosmetics moved over to my API\n- completely reworked how **runs/chests are tracked**\n- added proper **bug reports + debug zips** so tracking issues should be WAY easier to figure out\n\n**fixes**\n- fixed same-tier croesus loot sometimes not counting properly, especially rare drops\n- fixed croesus getting confused after doing kuudra\n- late croesus chests can now reconnect to the correct run for up to **15 mins**, even after restarting\n- fixed essence `xN` parsing + duplicate GUI stacks\n- orphaned chests won't just make up a fake run anymore\n- incomplete/truncated loot captures now get flagged\n- config saves are safer + have a backup now\n\n**also coming with it**\n- reset buttons need a confirmation now so you can't accidentally wipe stuff\n- fixed double clicking **Reset F7** sometimes triggering **Reset All**\n- run counts are restored from completions now, deleting loot won't delete runs\n- dropping support for 1.21.11"
		},
